{"id":454,"name":"toxicroak","speciesId":454,"dex":454,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["poison","fighting"],"stats":{"hp":83,"attack":106,"defense":65,"special-attack":86,"special-defense":65,"speed":85},"abilities":[{"name":"anticipation","hidden":false},{"name":"dry-skin","hidden":false},{"name":"poison-touch","hidden":true}],"height":13,"weight":444,"baseExp":172,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/454.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/454.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/454.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/454.ogg","genus":"Toxic Mouth Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."},{"version":"pearl","text":"The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws."},{"version":"black-2","text":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac."},{"version":"sword","text":"It bounces toward opponents and gouges them with poisonous claws. No more than a scratch is needed to knock out its adversaries."},{"version":"shield","text":"It booms out a victory croak when its prey goes down in defeat. This Pokémon and Seismitoad are related species."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its crimson claws contain a virulent toxin. This toxin can be made into a tonic by diluting it, mixing it with several types of wild grass, and boili